Package: diagcounts
Type: Package
Title: Recover Diagnostic Test Accuracy Counts from Reported Accuracy
        Measures
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-01-09
Authors@R: 
    person("Conrad", "Kabali", , "conrad.kabali@utoronto.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements a system of linear equations to recover
    unreported diagnostic test accuracy cell counts from commonly
    reported measures such as sensitivity, specificity, predictive
    values, prevalence, and sample size. The package is intended for
    applied researchers who require complete 2x2 table counts for
    downstream analyses.
